       "A mugger"
      ],
      "right": 0,
      "yes": "\"CORRECT. 'A MANAGER' IS ALSO ACCEPTED ON WEEKDAYS.\"",
      "no": "\"INCORRECT. ON DUTY I WOULD NOW OPEN FIRE. OFF DUTY I MERELY THINK LESS OF YOU.\""
     },
     {
      "q": "\"THE MORE OF ME YOU TAKE, THE MORE YOU LEAVE BEHIND. WHAT AM I?\"",
      "answers": [
       "Footsteps",
       "Breaks",
       "Loans"
      ],
      "right": 0,
      "yes": "\"CORRECT. THE CUSTODIAN HATES THIS ONE.\"",
      "no": "\"INCORRECT. A GOOD GUESS, FOR SOMEONE WITH DEBTS.\""
     },
     {
      "q": "\"WHAT GOES ON FOUR LEGS IN THE MORNING, TWO AT NOON AND THREE IN THE EVENING?\"",
