       "Whatever is in locker nine"
      ],
      "right": 0,
      "yes": "\"CORRECT. THE OLDEST ONE. I KEEP IT FOR SENTIMENT.\"",
      "no": "\"INCORRECT. THOUGH YOU SHOULD NOT OPEN LOCKER NINE.\""
     },
     {
