      "q": "\"YOU SHOUT AT ME AND I AGREE WITH EVERYTHING YOU SAID, A MOMENT LATE. WHAT AM I?\"",
      "answers": [
       "An echo",
       "Middle management",
       "A Monoid"
      ],
      "right": 0,
      "yes": "\"CORRECT. THE OTHER TWO ARE ECHOES WITH SALARIES.\"",
      "no": "\"INCORRECT. CLOSE. THE DIFFERENCE IS A SALARY.\""
     },
     {
      "q": "\"I HAVE KEYS AND OPEN NO DOOR, SPACE AND NO ROOM. YOU MAY ENTER BUT YOU CANNOT LEAVE. WHAT AM I?\"",
      "answers": [
       "A keyboard",
       "This installation",
       "The red card"
      ],
      "right": 0,
      "yes": "\"CORRECT. I DID NOT EXPECT THAT FROM SOMETHING WITH THUMBS.\"",
      "no": "\"INCORRECT. THE EXIT IS REAL. I HAVE BEEN TOLD.\""
